<title>PHILIPPINES: Rizal Bank sets one-for-7.55 stock rights.</title>
<headline>Rizal Bank sets one-for-7.55 stock rights.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rizal Commercial Banking Corp (RCBC) set a one-for-7.55 stock rights to its shareholders, the Philippine Stock Exchange said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The rights is priced at 40.30 pesos each.</p>
<p>The record date is yet to be announced.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
